      "text": "#1–#4 = actual expansions, largest ub first; equal bounds use FIFO insertion order.\nInclude child first. Feasible partial selections update the incumbent: 0 → 40 → 58 → 70.\nA=1,C=0 entered the queue before A=1,C=1,B=0; neither tied node is expanded after best=70.",
